@startuml UC-30
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-30.md
title UC-30: Select Items for Checkout
footer Feature CART-05 | Business rules: BR-19, BR-23
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Guest / Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "CartController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "CartService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Tick / untick one line or "Select all"
MVC -> API : PUT /api/cart/selection { itemIds, selected }
API -> SVC : SetSelectionAsync(cartOwner, itemIds, selected)
SVC -> DB : Load lines WHERE Id IN itemIds AND owned by cartOwner
alt selecting an unavailable line (BR-10)
  SVC --> API : Conflict
  API --> MVC : 409 Conflict
  MVC --> U : Show "This item is unavailable"
else ok
  SVC -> DB : Set IsSelected on the lines\nSaveChangesAsync
  SVC --> API : CartDto (selected total)
  API --> MVC : 200 OK
  MVC --> U : Show selected total
end
note over SVC : Only selected lines are checked out (BR-23)

@enduml
